        },
        {
          "text": "Ndakapalulwa mubuzuba bwamusanu aatatu bwakuzyalwa, ndi wamusyobo waIsrayeli, ndi wamukowa wa-Benjamini, ndi mu-Hebrayo mwinimwini, nkabela kumakani aa-Mulao ndi mu-Farisi. ",
