          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee, mbukabede Zintu zyoonse ndaziyeeya mbuli zintu zyabuyo nkaambo ka cintu eci ciinda loko kubota cakuziba Jesu Kristo Mwami wangu, Nkaambo kanguwe nkindakalekela zintu zyoonse, ndaziyeeya kuti masifwisifwi buyo mukuyanda kuti njane Kristo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
