                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Njandisya kuziba Kristo anguzu zyabubuke bwakwe alumvwanano lwamaciswe aakwe, Njanda kuba mbubonya mbwaakabede mulufu lwakwe, ",
          "type": "text",
