                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino mbuboobo mbutweelede kuyeeya toonse notubwene twaansi, nkabela na kuli cintu niciba comwe ncimuyeeyela bumbi, Leza ulamuyubunwida makani. ",
